    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Milking Clicker Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic controls are just mouse clicks and the wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you click, the more milk you can produce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect milk, sell it and earn money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Screen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793740/extras/5b45c3f3111e71a45bdf3da9b217b37a.avif?t=1754950471\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left window: Click on the heroine to milk her</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Middle window: Display status</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right window: Use money to purchase items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modify the heroine's body to increase breast milk production</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793740/extras/cd4e3604d92125b392771eee7c4eb95c.avif?t=1754950471\" width=468 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell breast milk and earn money to buy medicine to enlarge her breasts,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase her breast milk production with various approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You can also return to the appearance before modification.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Milking Clicker Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic controls are just mouse clicks and the wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you click, the more milk you can produce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect milk, sell it and earn money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Screen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793740/extras/5b45c3f3111e71a45bdf3da9b217b37a.avif?t=1754950471\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left window: Click on the heroine to milk her</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Middle window: Display status</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right window: Use money to purchase items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modify the heroine's body to increase breast milk production</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793740/extras/cd4e3604d92125b392771eee7c4eb95c.avif?t=1754950471\" width=468 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell breast milk and earn money to buy medicine to enlarge her breasts,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase her breast milk production with various approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You can also return to the appearance before modification.</p>",
